1657 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 802 0 R
/E (Asymptotic notations are mathematical tools used to analyze and compare the performance of algorithms as the input size \(n\) becomes very large. They help us understand how an algorithm's execution time or memory requirement grows without considering the actual hardware or programming language.)
/Pg 58 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
